# Both images build from the repo root, so this list is what never reaches a
# build context. Secrets first: backend/.env holds ClickHouse and Langfuse
# credentials and must never be baked into a layer — compose injects it at run
# time via `env_file` instead.
**/.env
**/.env.local
!**/.env.example

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/uploads
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.gitignore
.claude
**/*.log
docker-compose.yml
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
